Tools for feed2imap-go
----------------------

Currently included:
* `print-cache`: Print details about feeds part of the cache and the cached contents.
* `compare-mails.sh`: Development helper. Renders the mails (HTML and text) of a set of feeds with the
  current worktree and with a given revision, and compares them. See the script header for usage.

Note to packagers: `print-cache` is mostly a debugging tool, inclusion in packages is optional.
